    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like im running on a treadmill that keeps getting faster and i dont even have any shoes on. every single cent i make goes to things i dont even want just so i can stay in this apartment and keep working so i can pay for the apartment. it’s like the math just doesn't work anymore. i'm just working to exist, and existing is getting way too expensive.",
